@baseUrl = http://localhost:5240
@characterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Sign in using Identity.http first. Copy the authenticated antiforgery token.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/antiforgery

### Available bundled creation options
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/rulesets

### Create an incomplete, durably initialized Character
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/characters
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgeryToken}}

{
  "name": "Mira",
  "rulesetId": "DND5E5",
  "packId": "srd-5.2.1",
  "packVersion": "0.1.0",
  "characterElementId": "srd521:character:default"
}

### Owner-only collection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters?offset=0

### Reopen; absent or another owner's identifier returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}
